  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></munderover><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math> (where&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer function) is equal to"
